* {{rhymes|en|ɪstə(ɹ)|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|electronics}} A [[semiconductor]] [[diode]] having an extra "[[gate]]" [[terminal]] to [[switch]] it on.
